{
 "title": "? 运算符",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "嵌套的 `match` 很快就会变得复杂。**`?` 运算符**把错误向上传递：如果被调用的函数返回 `Ok(v)`，`?` 就取出值 `v`；如果返回 `Err(e)`，你所在的函数会**立即**停止，并把同一个错误返回给它的调用者。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn step_one() -> Result[i32, str]:",
    "    return Ok(10)",
    "",
    "fn step_two(x: i32) -> Result[i32, str]:",
    "    if x > 5:",
    "        return Ok(x * 2)",
    "    return Err(\"x is too small\")",
    "",
    "fn workflow() -> Result[i32, str]:",
    "    val1 = step_one()?",
    "    val2 = step_two(val1)?",
    "    return Ok(val2 + 5)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    match workflow():",
    "        Ok(v):",
    "            print(\"succeeded:\", v)",
    "        Err(msg):",
    "            print(\"failed:\", msg)"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "succeeded: 25"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "规则：`?` 只能用在完整的表达式中（`x = f()?`、`return f()?`、`f()?`）。不能用在 `g(f()?)` 或 `x += f()?` 这样的子表达式中。"
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c08-l04-x1",
   "prompt": "编写 `parse_and_double(a: i32) -> Result[i32, str]`：用 `check(a)?` 验证（负数时为 `Err(\"negative\")`），然后返回 `Ok(a * 2)`。用 21 和 -4 试一试。",
   "starter": [
    "fn check(a: i32) -> Result[i32, str]:",
    "    if a < 0:",
    "        return Err(\"negative\")",
    "    return Ok(a)",
    "",
    "fn parse_and_double(a: i32) -> Result[i32, str]:",
    "    return Ok(0)",
    "",
    "fn show(a: i32):",
    "    match parse_and_double(a):",
    "        Ok(v):",
    "            print(\"ok\", v)",
    "        Err(m):",
    "            print(\"error:\", m)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    show(21)",
    "    show(-4)"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn check(a: i32) -> Result[i32, str]:",
    "    if a < 0:",
    "        return Err(\"negative\")",
    "    return Ok(a)",
    "",
    "fn parse_and_double(a: i32) -> Result[i32, str]:",
    "    v = check(a)?",
    "    return Ok(v * 2)",
    "",
    "fn show(a: i32):",
    "    match parse_and_double(a):",
    "        Ok(v):",
    "            print(\"ok\", v)",
    "        Err(m):",
    "            print(\"error:\", m)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    show(21)",
    "    show(-4)"
   ],
   "hint": "写 `v = check(a)?`，然后返回 `Ok(v * 2)`。",
   "expected": [
    "ok 42",
    "error: negative"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c08-l04-q1",
   "q": "在 `x = f()?` 中，如果 `f()` 返回 `Err`，会怎样？",
   "options": [
    "`x` 变成 0",
    "当前函数立即返回同一个错误",
    "程序崩溃"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`?` 提前返回，并把错误向上传递。"
  }
 ]
}
